ore_item_assets/steam/apps/3057190/extras/2a9328720066af459c301d930f8bc025.webm?t=1761899833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057190/extras/2a9328720066af459c301d930f8bc025.mp4?t=1761899833\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057190/extras/d5db034eb6bbcc8b4cd56fa263b46164.avif?t=1761899833\" width=\"608\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>CAT WARNING!!!\u00a0</strong>\u26a0\ufe0f\u26a0\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to bend the rules? So are these cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They might look like your friends\u2014but these cheeky lil dudes are complete wildcards. (Just like real cats)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been warned, my friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057190/extras/1cac308b84bc511d5ed92eeddcf0a39a.avif?t=1761899833\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Yes, I, the dev, have been soft-locked by cats in the past. No, I am not proud of that)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED.\u00a0</strong>\u26a0\ufe0f\u26a0\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Re-arrange items, discover synergies, bend the rules, and break the game! LOOTPLOT is a points-based, inventory builder Roguelite centered around items, which all have a unique twist.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057190/header.jpg?t=1761899833", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Roguelike", "Roguelite", "2D", "Pixel Graphics", "Singleplayer"], "develope